    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Kekuatan Mi Yue ada di split push dan duel, hampir gak ada lawan, tapi butuh gold banget. Kalau awalnya gak jalan, dia lemah di teamfight late. Saran: Yango/Meng Tian/Ma Chao/Fuzi (clash), Luna (jungle), Sima Yi/Liang (mage), Donghuang (support), Di Renjie/Arli (marksman). Tanpa control susah bunuh Mi Yue, jadi di awal cukup tahan dia dan jaga jungle."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
      "url": "https://hokstats.gg/heroes/mi-yue/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "skills": [
          {
            "name": "Eternal Youth",
            "description": "Summons a shadow servant that damages enemies and restores Health to her whenever she uses a skill. She also gains Shadow Power that boosts her Movement Speed and healing effects.",
            "type": "passive"
          },
          {
            "name": "Dark Transfer",
            "description": "Unleashes shadow energy, dealing damage to enemies that come into contact with it. Can use the skill again to teleport to the shadow's location, dealing damage again. Summons a shadow servant when either use of the skill hits an enemy.",
            "type": "skill1"
          },
          {
            "name": "Ravenous Tether",
            "description": "Releases a tether that links to the first enemy hit. Damages and slows over time. Steals Physical and Magical Attack while recovering Health.",
            "type": "skill2"
          },
          {
            "name": "Umbral Moon",
            "description": "Removes debuffs, gains Movement Speed, and becomes untargetable. Deals damage to nearby enemies upon entering and exiting the untargetable state.",
            "type": "ultimate"
          }
        ],
        "pick_when": [
          "The enemy lacks reliable healing reduction, leaving sustain unchecked",
          "The enemy team relies on hard engage that you can read and recover from",
          "The enemy draft includes Mai Shiranui and Wukong, who appear in counter data as matchups Mi Yue can pressure."
        ],
        "avoid_when": [
          "The game state demands burst rather than slow attrition",
          "The enemy chains crowd control faster than recovery cooldowns refresh",
          "The enemy already drafted Dharma and Dian Wei, who counter data identifies as direct answers to Mi Yue."
        ],
        "power_spikes": [
          "Early game: Mi Yue is listed as an early-game threat in public guide data — convert the early window into objectives before scaling picks come online.",
          "Lifesteal item online: trade patterns flip from neutral to favorable once sustain stacks with damage",
          "Late game: cooldowns become short enough that Ravenous Tether influences every team fight rather than being a one-shot tool."
        ],
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Forcing all-ins against opponents already wearing anti-heal — your healing barely activates.",
          "Using the recovery skill on the first crowd control, then dying to the follow-up chain.",
          "Ignoring Dharma on the enemy team when picking fights — counter data flags them as direct answers, so engage timing must respect their cooldowns.",
          "Forcing solo engages instead of waiting for ally commit — Mi Yue's value compounds when the team follows up on engages."
        ],
